sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Cashier
    participant Main as main()
    participant Rest as r: Restaurant
    participant FM as fm: FileManager
    participant File as Data Files (.txt)

    Note over User, File: 1. System Startup - Automatic Load
    User->>Main: Execute ./Executable/Project
    Main->>Rest: Restaurant() constructor
    Note over Rest: Allocate dynamic arrays (menuItems, customers, orders, bills)
    Main->>Rest: run()
    Rest->>Rest: loadData()
    activate Rest

    Rest->>FM: loadMenuItems(menuItems, capacity, "menu_items.txt")
    activate FM
    FM->>File: Open "menu_items.txt"
    loop For each record line
        File-->>FM: Read pipe-delimited record
        FM->>FM: Inspect type token (FOOD / BEVERAGE)
        Note over FM: Dynamic polymorphism: new FoodItem() or new BeverageItem()
        FM->>FM: invoke fromFileString(line)
        FM->>FM: Store in menuItems array (resize if count == cap)
    end
    FM-->>Rest: Return loaded itemCount
    deactivate FM

    Rest->>FM: loadCustomers(customers, capacity, "customers.txt")
    FM->>File: Read records & populate dynamic array
    FM-->>Rest: Return customerCount

    Rest->>FM: loadOrders(orders, capacity, "orders.txt")
    FM->>File: Read records & deserialize itemIds/quantities
    FM-->>Rest: Return orderCount

    Rest->>FM: loadBills(bills, capacity, "bills.txt")
    FM->>File: Read records & deserialize bill data
    FM-->>Rest: Return billCount

    Rest-->>User: Display Startup Confirmation Banner
    deactivate Rest

    Note over User, File: 2. System Shutdown - Automatic Save
    User->>Rest: Select Menu Option 9 (Exit)
    activate Rest
    Rest->>Rest: saveData()

    Rest->>FM: saveMenuItems(menuItems, menuCount, "menu_items.txt")
    activate FM
    FM->>File: Open ofstream
    loop For each item i in menuItems
        FM->>FM: polymorphic call item[i]->toFileString()
        FM->>File: Write serialized line
    end
    FM-->>Rest: File write complete
    deactivate FM

    Rest->>FM: saveCustomers(customers, count, "customers.txt")
    FM->>File: Write customer serialized lines
    FM-->>Rest: File write complete

    Rest->>FM: saveOrders(orders, count, "orders.txt")
    FM->>File: Write order serialized lines
    FM-->>Rest: File write complete

    Rest->>FM: saveBills(bills, count, "bills.txt")
    FM->>File: Write bill serialized lines
    FM-->>Rest: File write complete

    Rest-->>User: Display "Data saved. Thank you!"
    deactivate Rest

    Main->>Rest: ~Restaurant() destructor
    Note over Rest: Free dynamic memory: delete each MenuItem*, delete[] arrays
    Main-->>User: Exit Process (code 0)
